{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning","doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/TuningSystem"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/TuningSystem\/werckmeisterIII","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"text":"Werckmeister III (Andreas Werckmeister, 1691).","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivortuning\/tuningsystem\/werckmeisteriii"]}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"externalID":"s:10IvorTuning0B6SystemPA2A15WellTemperamentVRszrlE15werckmeisterIIIAEvpZ","symbolKind":"property","title":"werckmeisterIII","modules":[{"name":"IvorTuning"}],"roleHeading":"Type Property","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"werckmeisterIII"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"WellTemperament","preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorTuning15WellTemperamentV"}],"role":"symbol","conformance":{"constraints":[{"code":"Self","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"WellTemperament","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"text":"Conforms when","type":"text"}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"text":"Available when","type":"text"}]},"extendedModule":"IvorTuning"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"werckmeisterIII"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorTuning15WellTemperamentV","text":"WellTemperament","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/WellTemperament","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"],"plat